# The fork's code patches over upstream: one line each, tab-separated.
#   <commit subject>	<the paths it may change, space-separated>
# A patch is found by its exact subject in <upstream tag>..<commit>, so its
# hash may change when it is carried to a newer upstream. Each patch carries
# its own tests. lazurio/fork-check.sh allows a difference from upstream only
# in lazurio/, in these paths and in package.json's version;
# lazurio/upstream-check.sh carries these patches onto a newer upstream tag.
embed --stale: hand the drain to a resident PGLite owner (writer_embed_stale)	src/commands/embed.ts src/cli/main.ts src/core/persistence/admin-contract.ts src/core/persistence/administration.ts src/commands/embed-stale-delegate.ts src/core/persistence/embed-stale-administration.ts test/embed-stale-delegate.test.ts
embeddings enable: record the model and width in the database plane too	src/commands/embeddings.ts test/embeddings-enable-db-plane.test.ts
